{
  "schema_version": "effectslice-fg1-atom-registry.v1",
  "task_id": "DATA-SNAP-02",
  "atoms": [
    {
      "atom_id": "a_76e9af1177d68825",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "61b608096e6ccbc05b0d565fb2835769b6ae232de11cc10eaf0f7094a05ca9f3",
        "byte_start": 457,
        "byte_end": 554,
        "split_index": 0
      },
      "rendered_text": "Implement `matrix_free_spectral_operator` through `solve(case)` for this bounded objective: Apply the normalized matrix-free spectral operator and return deterministically ordered leading coordinates from a supplied eigensolver fixture.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "f411ae9396174dde30724cbd20fd078330831216ed7e85266a480e3f1888682f"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_05db3b89c93b3988",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "61b608096e6ccbc05b0d565fb2835769b6ae232de11cc10eaf0f7094a05ca9f3",
        "byte_start": 457,
        "byte_end": 554,
        "split_index": 1
      },
      "rendered_text": "Stay inside this mechanism boundary: Matrix-free operator, eigensolver interface, sign/order normalization, and no-materialization guard. Validate every required field before computing a result.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "ce2437132d198200f2b8151024279214b0774592f3cea44901c8591c43a7a340"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_7ffe2bec2fcabea8",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "61b608096e6ccbc05b0d565fb2835769b6ae232de11cc10eaf0f7094a05ca9f3",
        "byte_start": 457,
        "byte_end": 554,
        "split_index": 2
      },
      "rendered_text": "Multiply each feature column by its supplied IDF.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "69bca0787d48ce4c2b6ca3d3c87cd738147c66f49b41a443d0cc2bf7a944916c"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_b7d7b34d14014fa0",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "61b608096e6ccbc05b0d565fb2835769b6ae232de11cc10eaf0f7094a05ca9f3",
        "byte_start": 457,
        "byte_end": 554,
        "split_index": 3
      },
      "rendered_text": "Define each row degree as the squared norm with a positive numerical floor.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "5a4808c69a8f96e15d24a8400e4a89672f830de520702430c129f52e8eef584a"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_d00b33ab0db10c3f",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "61b608096e6ccbc05b0d565fb2835769b6ae232de11cc10eaf0f7094a05ca9f3",
        "byte_start": 457,
        "byte_end": 554,
        "split_index": 4
      },
      "rendered_text": "Apply inverse square-root degree scaling to the input vector.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "a056569ad27608818668df6f62336b41eb230cbd872bc00eb84e91797302ff09"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_d2a22bf7c7bccd3b",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "61b608096e6ccbc05b0d565fb2835769b6ae232de11cc10eaf0f7094a05ca9f3",
        "byte_start": 457,
        "byte_end": 554,
        "split_index": 5
      },
      "rendered_text": "Compute X times X-transpose through two sparse-style matrix-vector products and rescale rows.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "ef50c830f41b1ad85620905bd50b8c782fc9958f97784b76a097cfd9e9533864"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_75e5846d603d67ed",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "61b608096e6ccbc05b0d565fb2835769b6ae232de11cc10eaf0f7094a05ca9f3",
        "byte_start": 571,
        "byte_end": 654,
        "split_index": 6
      },
      "rendered_text": "Return the rounded operator result and degrees without constructing a pairwise matrix.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "103e3d813e5922865e29e84463fc17e5336728429ef5097b4f1cdf23c063b31a"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_a2192c2da4d1a23e",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "61b608096e6ccbc05b0d565fb2835769b6ae232de11cc10eaf0f7094a05ca9f3",
        "byte_start": 571,
        "byte_end": 654,
        "split_index": 7
      },
      "rendered_text": "Treat these registered properties as hard contracts rather than soft preferences: matrix_free, coordinate_order, sign_normalized, numeric_tolerance.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "c2af8d192a394f4d6483d894d950136ea859e82e8caadf71e138f492ecbfd369"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_b7231cc0296a77bd",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "61b608096e6ccbc05b0d565fb2835769b6ae232de11cc10eaf0f7094a05ca9f3",
        "byte_start": 571,
        "byte_end": 654,
        "split_index": 8
      },
      "rendered_text": "Use only quantities present in the case payload. Do not call a language model, network service, random generator, wall clock, or environment-dependent resource.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "bb651964decf660706e6b02a72268f4df8c9cfde1515a5b2325af47505fa92df"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_71b19664a1ac0f96",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "61b608096e6ccbc05b0d565fb2835769b6ae232de11cc10eaf0f7094a05ca9f3",
        "byte_start": 571,
        "byte_end": 654,
        "split_index": 9
      },
      "rendered_text": "Preserve every source identifier needed to audit the decision, and compute aggregate values from the returned primitive decisions rather than from a second approximation.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "d6b67e3cd654a61b271920e037938dc07550072b2334416f32ed86b0bd787362"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_1e0103cbd7caedb2",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "61b608096e6ccbc05b0d565fb2835769b6ae232de11cc10eaf0f7094a05ca9f3",
        "byte_start": 571,
        "byte_end": 654,
        "split_index": 10
      },
      "rendered_text": "Do not mutate the input. All ranking and traversal ties use the source position or identifier specified above; never depend on hash-map iteration.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "67186a43fcf39ec73132c8ab7ad1387670a6fd7d5e511075a50faf835be9e19a"
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "a_d5d5421a3303035b",
      "source_locator": {
        "document_sha256": "61b608096e6ccbc05b0d565fb2835769b6ae232de11cc10eaf0f7094a05ca9f3",
        "byte_start": 571,
        "byte_end": 654,
        "split_index": 11
      },
      "rendered_text": "Return only JSON-serializable values with the exact named fields. Raise ValueError for an infeasible or structurally invalid case instead of silently repairing it.",
      "rendered_text_sha256": "5f164e6574e6f249d67514f65fc480435c9b737c31ea45311cd04552b1d13fcb"
    }
  ]
}
